cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rigor audit agents for ML and geoscience pipelines"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Seelig"
    given-names: "Luis Felipe Comodo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6095-3864"
abstract: >-
  A framework of Claude Code subagents, campaign skills, protocols and small
  standard-library tools for auditing the rigor of machine-learning and
  geoscience pipelines: narrow fronts that answer one question with a
  script-backed JSON artifact, adversarial verification by three votes with
  execution-only refutation, a coverage critic, and a coordinator that judges
  only artifacts. Includes a synthetic geospatial example with a planted
  spatial leakage and a planted unseeded split.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - machine learning
  - geoscience
  - spatial cross-validation
  - data leakage
  - research software
  - AI agents
  - audit
